  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 404.06 Unauthorized Practice. When the board determines which measures are likely to be the most effective way to stop unauthorized practice as defined in RSA 326-K:5, the board shall initiate an action pursuant to RSA 541-A:30, III.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
